            "[+] Calculating Morphine Milligram Equivalents (MME):\n",
            "    - Morphine 60mg (PO - ER) [Sulfate] -> 60.00 MME\n",
            "    - Hydromorphone 2mg (IV - IR) [Hydrochloride] -> 40.00 MME\n",
            "    - Oxycodone 15mg (PO - IR) [Hydrochloride] -> 22.50 MME\n",
            "    - Morphine 60mg (PO - IR) [Hydrochloride] -> 51.00 MME\n",
            "    - Fentanyl 0.1mg (IV - IR) [Citrate] -> 30.00 MME\n",
            "\n",
            "[!] Total 24h MME: 203.50 mg\n",
            "\n",
            "[*] Generating Pharmacokinetic charts...\n"
